  {
   "id": "miasma-chronicles-201795@1.01",
   "gameId": "miasma-chronicles-201795",
   "displayName": "Update 1.01",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-05-30T15:11:55.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "My name is James, Brand Community Manager at 505 Games and working with The Bearded Ladies on Miasma Chronicles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Firstly, we want to thank everyone who picked up the game last week, the response has been AMAZING and team Miasma are really feeling the love <3 - thank you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve seen a small number of players across report that they’re receiving crashes and some bugs, don’t worry we’re on it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From today, you’ll begin to see updates rolling across steam to ensure that your experience is the best it can be.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PC players will receive the first of our balancing fixes. Including reductions of damage from certain enemies and a shift in the Narrative mode’s difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ll be keeping a close eye on all your feedback and reports, they're really helpful and allow us to make the best game we want you to play.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please follow our official social media channels to keep up to date with the latest news.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Miasma Chronicles: Steam v1.01 Patch Notes – 30th May 2023",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "STABILITY/BUGS",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Multiple crash fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A fix for Elvis potentially missing in final cutscene.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING FIXES",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
